Drop AST dep from structure.rs

structure.rs no longer imports anything from crate::ast. var_els is
keyed by the variable's source name (String) instead of VarTermId.
semantic_el moved out of Structure; Structures and StructureId are
gone.

algebraize.rs now owns the AST-facing plumbing:
  - Snapshot { structure, semantic_el: BTreeMap<TermId, ElId> }
    bundles a Structure with its term-to-element provenance.
  - RuleStructures { initial, stmt_before, stmt_after } groups all
    snapshots for one rule, keyed by StmtId.
  - build_structures returns
    (BTreeMap<RuleDeclId, RuleStructures>, Vec<CompileError>).
  - Walkers thread &mut Snapshot as `current` and insert Snapshot
    clones into the RuleStructures tables directly.
  - close_snapshot closes one snapshot's Structure and translates
    every returned TypeConflict to a CompileError using that
    snapshot's own semantic_el.
